---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Discord Bot Setup — CircuitBot" description="Create and configure a Discord bot for CircuitBot in 5 minutes.">
  <section class="section doc-header">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <a href="/docs" class="back-link">
        <span class="back-arrow">&lt;--</span>
        Back to Docs
      </a>
      <span class="badge badge-purple">// GUIDE</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">Discord Bot Setup</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Create and configure a Discord bot application so CircuitBot can connect to your server. This takes about 5 minutes.</p>
      <div class="reading-time">[ 5 min read ]</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider" />

  <article class="section doc-content">
    <div class="container-narrow">

      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <section class="doc-section" id="developer-portal">
        <h2><span class="heading-num">01</span> Open the Developer Portal</h2>
        <p>Go to the Discord Developer Portal:</p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          <a href="https://discord.com/developers/applications" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">
            <span class="btn-icon">&gt;_</span>
            discord.com/developers/applications
          </a>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">Log in with your Discord account if you are not already signed in.</p>
      </section>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <section class="doc-section" id="create-application">
        <h2><span class="heading-num">02</span> Create a New Application</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Click the <strong>"New Application"</strong> button in the top-right corner.</li>
          <li>Give it a name -- for example, <strong>"CircuitBot"</strong> or your team name. This name will appear in your server's member list.</li>
          <li>Accept the Developer Terms of Service and click <strong>"Create"</strong>.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="mt-4">You will land on the application's General Information page. You can optionally add a description and app icon here.</p>
      </section>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <section class="doc-section" id="bot-settings">
        <h2><span class="heading-num">03</span> Bot Settings</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>In the left sidebar, click <strong>"Bot"</strong>.</li>
          <li>Click <strong>"Add Bot"</strong> and confirm.</li>
          <li>Under the bot's username, click <strong>"Reset Token"</strong> to generate a new token, then click <strong>"Copy"</strong>.</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="callout callout-warn mt-4">
          <div class="callout-label">WARNING</div>
          <strong>Keep this token secret.</strong> Your bot token is like a password -- anyone who has it can control your bot. Never commit it to version control, paste it in public channels, or share it in screenshots. If it is ever exposed, return here and click "Reset Token" immediately.
        </div>

        <p class="mt-4">You will paste this token into the CircuitBot setup wizard (Step 2 of the <a href="/docs/setup#wizard">Setup Guide</a>).</p>

        <div class="terminal mt-4">
          <div class="terminal-bar">
            <span class="terminal-dot red"></span>
            <span class="terminal-dot yellow"></span>
            <span class="terminal-dot green"></span>
            <span class="terminal-title">bot_token.env</span>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-body">
            <div><span class="comment"># Your token will look something like this:</span></div>
            <div><span class="cmd">MTIzNDU2Nzg5MDEy.XXXXXX.XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</span></div>
            <div class="mt-2"><span class="comment"># Paste this into the CircuitBot setup wizard</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <section class="doc-section" id="intents">
        <h2><span class="heading-num">04</span> Privileged Gateway Intents</h2>
        <p>Still on the Bot page, scroll down to the <strong>"Privileged Gateway Intents"</strong> section. Enable the following:</p>

        <div class="intent-list mt-6">
          <div class="intent-item intent-required">
            <div class="intent-header">
              <div class="intent-toggle">
                <div class="intent-toggle-track on">
                  <div class="intent-toggle-thumb"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="intent-info">
                <h4>Message Content Intent</h4>
                <span class="intent-badge required">Required</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p>CircuitBot needs to read the content of messages where it is @mentioned. Without this intent, the bot receives empty message bodies and cannot process tasks.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="intent-item">
            <div class="intent-header">
              <div class="intent-toggle">
                <div class="intent-toggle-track on">
                  <div class="intent-toggle-thumb"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="intent-info">
                <h4>Server Members Intent</h4>
                <span class="intent-badge optional">Optional</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p>Allows CircuitBot to resolve user display names in logs and the dashboard. The bot works without this, but you will see user IDs instead of names.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-6">Click <strong>"Save Changes"</strong> at the bottom of the page.</p>
      </section>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <!-- Step 5 -->
      <section class="doc-section" id="oauth2">
        <h2><span class="heading-num">05</span> Generate the Invite URL</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>In the left sidebar, click <strong>"OAuth2"</strong>.</li>
          <li>Under <strong>"OAuth2 URL Generator"</strong>, select the scope: <code>bot</code>.</li>
          <li>In the <strong>"Bot Permissions"</strong> section that appears, check the following permissions:</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="permissions-grid mt-4">
          <div class="permission-item">
            <div class="permission-check"></div>
            <span>Send Messages</span>
          </div>
          <div class="permission-item">
            <div class="permission-check"></div>
            <span>Read Message History</span>
          </div>
          <div class="permission-item">
            <div class="permission-check"></div>
            <span>Read Messages / View Channels</span>
          </div>
          <div class="permission-item">
            <div class="permission-check"></div>
            <span>Embed Links</span>
          </div>
          <div class="permission-item">
            <div class="permission-check"></div>
            <span>Attach Files</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ol start="4" class="mt-4">
          <li>Scroll down and copy the <strong>"Generated URL"</strong>.</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="terminal mt-4">
          <div class="terminal-bar">
            <span class="terminal-dot red"></span>
            <span class="terminal-dot yellow"></span>
            <span class="terminal-dot green"></span>
            <span class="terminal-title">oauth2_url.txt</span>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-body">
            <div><span class="comment"># Your URL will look like this:</span></div>
            <div><span class="cmd">https://discord.com/api/oauth2/authorize?client_id=YOUR_APP_ID&permissions=117760&scope=bot</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <!-- Step 6 -->
      <section class="doc-section" id="invite">
        <h2><span class="heading-num">06</span> Invite the Bot to Your Server</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Open the generated URL in your web browser.</li>
          <li>Discord shows an authorization page. Select the server you want to add the bot to from the dropdown.</li>
          <li>Review the requested permissions and click <strong>"Authorize"</strong>.</li>
          <li>Complete the CAPTCHA if prompted.</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="callout callout-info mt-4">
          <div class="callout-label">INFO</div>
          <strong>Note:</strong> You need the "Manage Server" permission on the target server to add a bot. If you do not see your server in the dropdown, ask the server owner to grant you this permission or to add the bot themselves using the URL.
        </div>
      </section>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <!-- Step 7 -->
      <section class="doc-section" id="verify">
        <h2><span class="heading-num">07</span> Verify the Bot</h2>
        <p>After authorization, the bot appears in your server's member list. It will show as <strong>offline</strong> -- this is expected. The bot only comes online when the CircuitBot desktop app is running and connected.</p>

        <div class="verify-checklist mt-6">
          <div class="verify-title">STATUS CHECK</div>
          <div class="verify-item">
            <div class="verify-check done"></div>
            <span>Bot visible in the server member list</span>
          </div>
          <div class="verify-item">
            <div class="verify-check done"></div>
            <span>Bot token copied and ready for the setup wizard</span>
          </div>
          <div class="verify-item">
            <div class="verify-check done"></div>
            <span>Message Content Intent enabled</span>
          </div>
          <div class="verify-item">
            <div class="verify-check done"></div>
            <span>Correct permissions granted</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-6">You are all set. Head to the <a href="/docs/setup">Setup Guide</a> to connect this bot token to CircuitBot and start dispatching tasks.</p>
      </section>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="doc-nav mt-8">
        <a href="/docs/setup" class="btn">
          <span class="nav-arrow">&lt;--</span>
          Setup Guide
        </a>
        <a href="/docs" class="btn btn-primary">
          Back to Docs
          <span class="nav-arrow">--&gt;</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* ── Header ──────────────────────────────── */
  .doc-header {
    padding-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    transition: color 0.2s;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent-green);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .back-arrow {
    color: var(--accent-green);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 44px;
    font-weight: 400;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--accent-green);
    text-shadow:
      0 0 10px rgba(46, 204, 94, 0.4),
      0 0 40px rgba(46, 204, 94, 0.15);
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 600px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .reading-time {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  /* ── Doc content ─────────────────────────── */
  .doc-content {
    padding-top: 40px;
  }

  .doc-section {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .doc-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 400;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .heading-num {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border: 2px solid var(--accent-purple);
    color: var(--accent-purple);
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: rgba(123, 92, 191, 0.06);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(123, 92, 191, 0.15);
  }

  .doc-section h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 400;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .doc-section h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 400;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .doc-section p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .doc-section ol,
  .doc-section ul {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding-left: 24px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .doc-section li {
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .doc-section code {
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: 13px;
    background: rgba(62, 235, 212, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(62, 235, 212, 0.15);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .doc-section a {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .btn-icon {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    margin-right: 6px;
  }

  /* ── Callouts ────────────────────────────── */
  .callout {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .callout strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .callout-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .callout-warn {
    background: rgba(230, 168, 50, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(230, 168, 50, 0.15);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-orange);
  }

  .callout-warn .callout-label {
    color: var(--accent-orange);
  }

  .callout-info {
    background: rgba(62, 235, 212, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(62, 235, 212, 0.12);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .callout-info .callout-label {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  /* ── Intent toggles ──────────────────────── */
  .intent-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .intent-item {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .intent-item:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-light);
  }

  .intent-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .intent-info {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .intent-toggle-track {
    width: 40px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 11px;
    background: var(--border);
    position: relative;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .intent-toggle-track.on {
    background: var(--accent-green);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(46, 204, 94, 0.3);
  }

  .intent-toggle-thumb {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: white;
    position: absolute;
    top: 3px;
    left: 3px;
    transition: left 0.2s;
  }

  .intent-toggle-track.on .intent-toggle-thumb {
    left: 21px;
  }

  .intent-badge {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 400;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .intent-badge.required {
    background: rgba(239, 83, 80, 0.1);
    color: var(--accent-red);
    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 83, 80, 0.2);
  }

  .intent-badge.optional {
    background: rgba(62, 235, 212, 0.08);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    border: 1px solid rgba(62, 235, 212, 0.15);
  }

  .intent-item p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: 54px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  /* ── Permissions grid ────────────────────── */
  .permissions-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .permission-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .permission-check {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border: 2px solid var(--accent-green);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    position: relative;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: rgba(46, 204, 94, 0.06);
    box-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(46, 204, 94, 0.15);
  }

  .permission-check::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 2px;
    left: 5px;
    width: 5px;
    height: 9px;
    border: solid var(--accent-green);
    border-width: 0 2px 2px 0;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  /* ── Verify checklist ────────────────────── */
  .verify-checklist {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .verify-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--accent-green);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(46, 204, 94, 0.3);
  }

  .verify-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .verify-check {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--border-light);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .verify-check.done {
    background: rgba(46, 204, 94, 0.08);
    border-color: var(--accent-green);
    box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(46, 204, 94, 0.2);
  }

  .verify-check.done::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 3px;
    left: 6px;
    width: 5px;
    height: 9px;
    border: solid var(--accent-green);
    border-width: 0 2px 2px 0;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  /* ── Doc nav ─────────────────────────────── */
  .doc-nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .nav-arrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  /* ── Responsive ──────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .page-title {
      font-size: 32px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .doc-section h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .intent-item p {
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .intent-header {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .doc-nav {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
